\_protected\_def\_rmdigits    {\_umathrange{0-9}71\_digitrmO}
\_protected\_def\_bfdigits    {\_umathrange{0-9}71\_digitbfO}
\_protected\_def\_bbdigits    {\_umathrange{0-9}71\_digitbbO}
